From: venetanji <giovanni.lion@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 02:29:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Animated gifs reach the html deck whole

copy_asset re-encoded every image as jpeg (or png with alpha), which kept one frame
of an animated gif. An animated gif or webp is now copied as it is, name and frames
intact; the pptx already took the file as it was. A test covers both paths.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RdFxTgrpAFbL82dNscS9CL
